{"title":"운명을 바꾸는 천재 프로듀서","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=BXhwj/dJMcadbBAqz/Kdwm2GRHM8KRNE4VgfLxr1&filename=th3","synopsis":"실패한 인생이라 생각했을 때,\n인생 2회 차의 기회가 찾아온다.\n\n이번엔 다르다.\n대박 날 작품과 망할 작품, 뜰 배우와 망할 배우\n그리고 완벽한 투자 타이밍까지...\n이 바닥의 미래는 이미 내 손 안에 있다.\n\n기획안 하나로 판을 뒤흔들고,\n내 안의 경험과 감각이 업계를 지배한다.\n\n그렇게 망한 프로듀서였던 내가,\n한국 영상 산업의 신화를 이룩한다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":8846,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":8846,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":8846,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":8851,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":8851,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":8851,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":8851,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":8865,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":8922,"rc":131,"rs":1306,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":8995,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":9109,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":9169,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-23","v":9169,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-24","v":9172,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-25","v":9172,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-26","v":9186,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-27","v":9239,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3},{"date":"2026-10-28","v":9250,"rc":153,"rs":1382,"cc":3}]}